    AND `Regs Sch I place in CMA` place `er6 London CMA`

-- src:1790 | (9) The region of Niagara, consisting of
-- src:1791 | (a) the portion of Census Division No. 26 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Hamilton or the Census Metropolitan Area of St. Catharines — Niagara;
-- src:1792 | (b) the portion of Census Division No. 34 that lies east of and is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of London; and
-- src:1793 | (c) Census Division Nos. 28 and 29.
@ref Employment Insurance Regulations Schedule I s 2(9) (src:1790-1793)
GIVEN place IS A `er6 Place`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Regs Sch I s 2(9) the place is in the region of Niagara` IF
        `Regs Sch I place in province` place `er6 Ontario`
    AND (   (`Regs Sch I place in CD No.` place 26
                  AND NOT ((`Regs Sch I place in CMA` place `er6 Hamilton CMA` OR `Regs Sch I place in CMA` place `er6 St. Catharines — Niagara CMA`)))   -- (a)
         OR (`Regs Sch I place in CD No.` place 34
                  AND place's `east of the Census Metropolitan Area of London`
                  AND NOT (`Regs Sch I place in CMA` place `er6 London CMA`))   -- (b)
         OR `Regs Sch I place in CD Nos.` place (LIST 28, 29))   -- (c)

