-- src:1796 | (12) The region of Huron, consisting of
-- src:1797 | (a) the portion of Census Division No. 34 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of London or the region of Niagara;
-- src:1798 | (b) the portion of Census Division No. 37 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Windsor; and
