-- src:1810 | 3 (1) The region of Gaspésie-Îles-de-la-Madeleine, consisting of Census Division Nos. 1 to 8 and 98.
@ref Employment Insurance Regulations Schedule I s 3(1) (src:1810)
GIVEN place IS A `er6 Place`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Regs Sch I s 3(1) the place is in the region of Gaspésie-Îles-de-la-Madeleine` IF
        `Regs Sch I place in province` place `er6 Quebec`
    AND `Regs Sch I place in CD Nos.` place (append (`Regs Sch I whole numbers from` 1 `to` 8) (LIST 98))

