-- src:1812 | (3) The region of Central Quebec, consisting of
-- src:1813 | (a) those portions of Census Division Nos. 21 and 22 that are not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Quebec City;
-- src:1814 | (b) those portions of Census Division Nos. 37 and 38 that are not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Trois-Rivières;
-- src:1815 | (c) those portions of Census Division Nos. 41, 42, 44 and 45 that are not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Sherbrooke;
-- src:1816 | (d) those portions of Census Division Nos. 52, 60, 75 and 76 that are not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Montreal;
-- src:1817 | (e) the portion of Census Division No. 82 that is not part of the Census Metropolitan Area of Ottawa — Hull; and
-- src:1818 | (f) Census Division Nos. 31 to 36, 39, 40, 48, 49, 50, 51, 53, 61, 62, 63, 77, 78, 80 and 90.
@ref Employment Insurance Regulations Schedule I s 3(3) (src:1812-1818)
GIVEN place IS A `er6 Place`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Regs Sch I s 3(3) the place is in the region of Central Quebec` IF
        `Regs Sch I place in province` place `er6 Quebec`
    AND (   (`Regs Sch I place in CD Nos.` place (LIST 21, 22)
                  AND NOT (`Regs Sch I place in CMA` place `er6 Quebec City CMA`))   -- (a)
         OR (`Regs Sch I place in CD Nos.` place (LIST 37, 38)
                  AND NOT (`Regs Sch I place in CMA` place `er6 Trois-Rivières CMA`))   -- (b)
         OR (`Regs Sch I place in CD Nos.` place (LIST 41, 42, 44, 45)
                  AND NOT (`Regs Sch I place in CMA` place `er6 Sherbrooke CMA`))   -- (c)
         OR (`Regs Sch I place in CD Nos.` place (LIST 52, 60, 75, 76)
                  AND NOT (`Regs Sch I place in CMA` place `er6 Montreal CMA`))   -- (d)
         OR (`Regs Sch I place in CD No.` place 82 AND NOT (`Regs Sch I place in CMA` place `er6 Ottawa — Hull CMA`))   -- (e)
         OR `Regs Sch I place in CD Nos.` place (append (`Regs Sch I whole numbers from` 31 `to` 36) (LIST 39, 40, 48, 49, 50, 51, 53, 61, 62, 63, 77, 78, 80, 90)))   -- (f)

