GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Regs Sch I s 3(11) the place is in the region of Lower Saint Lawrence and North Shore` IF
        `Regs Sch I place in province` place `er6 Quebec`
    AND (   (`Regs Sch I place in CD No.` place 94
                  AND NOT (`Regs Sch I place in CMA` place `er6 Chicoutimi — Jonquière CMA`))   -- (a)
         OR `Regs Sch I place in CD Nos.` place (append (`Regs Sch I whole numbers from` 9 `to` 18) (LIST 28, 91, 92, 93, 95, 96, 97)))   -- (b)

