@ref Employment Insurance Regulations Schedule I s 5(1) (src:1844-1851)
GIVEN place IS A `er6 Place`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Regs Sch I s 5(1) the place is in the region of Fredericton — Moncton — Saint John` IF
        `Regs Sch I place in province` place `er6 New Brunswick`
    AND (   `Regs Sch I place in CD Nos.` place (LIST 1, 5)   -- (a)
         OR (`Regs Sch I place in CD No.` place 2 AND `Regs Sch I place in CMA` place `er6 Saint John CMA`)   -- (b)
         OR `Regs Sch I place in CSD Nos.` place (LIST 1303001, 1303004, 1303005, 1303006, 1303008, 1303011, 1303012, 1303013, 1303016)   -- (c)
         OR (`Regs Sch I place in CD No.` place 4 AND `Regs Sch I place in CMA` place `er6 Saint John CMA`)   -- (d)
         OR (`Regs Sch I place in CD No.` place 6 AND `Regs Sch I place in CA` place `er6 Moncton CA`)   -- (e)
         OR `Regs Sch I place in CSD Nos.` place (LIST 1307019, 1307022, 1307028, 1307045)   -- (f)
         OR (`Regs Sch I place in CD No.` place 10 AND `Regs Sch I place in CA` place `er6 Fredericton CA`))   -- (g)

